/-
  Syntax highlighting of printed source, shared by the explorer (HTML) and the CLI (ANSI colours
  on a terminal). Source splits into runs of one kind: kw(keyword), str(ing), cm (comment),
  ty(pe or other capitalized name), hint (a parameter name the explorer's printer put before an
  argument, D174) and plain text.
-/
def Highlight.keywords : Map Text Unit := Set.fromList ["def", "theorem", "test", "inductive", "structure", "ability", "namespace", "end", "match", "with", "fun", "let", "rec", "if", "then", "else", "handle", "return", "by", "where", "prim", "sorry"]